/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2018 StTriggerData2018

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 18 (year 2018) trigger data.

\section sec2018_overview Overview

StTriggerData2018 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 18 (year 2018)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TriggerDataBlk2018 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2018.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2017, Run 18 introduces a fuller EPD DSM layer hierarchy, VPD aggregate
quantities (ADC sum and mean time difference), a vertex DSM accessor, and run-blinding support.

\section sec2018_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2018
\endcode

\section sec2018_runyear Run Year
Run 18, calendar year 2018 &mdash; Au+Au collisions at &radic;s = 27 GeV.

\section sec2018_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TriggerDataBlk2018* | Pointer to the raw Run 18 trigger data block. |
| EvtDesc | EvtDescData2018* | Decoded event descriptor (transient). |
| L1_DSM  | L1_DSM_Data2018* | Decoded L1 DSM data (transient). |
| TrgSum  | TrgSumData2018* | Decoded trigger summary (transient). |
| mEQ1[11], mEQ2[11], mEQ3[11] | QTBlock2018*[11] | EPD QT crate blocks (transient). |

\section sec2018_new New Compared to 2017

<b>EPD DSM layer hierarchy:</b>
- epdTimeDifference()
- epdHitLayer2(StBeamDirection eastwest)
- epdLayer0t(int ch, int prepost=0)
- epdLayer1(int ch, int prepost=0)
- epdLayer0a(int ch, int prepost=0)
- epdNHits(StBeamDirection eastwest, int prepost=0)

<b>VPD aggregates:</b>
- vpdADCSum(StBeamDirection eastwest, int prepost=0)
- vpdMeanTimeDifference(int prepost=0) &mdash; returns float.

<b>Other:</b>
- vertexDSM(int channel) &mdash; vertex-finding DSM word.
- blindRunInfo() &mdash; blind run-identifying fields for blind analysis.

\section sec2018_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short epdNE = trgData->epdNHits(east, 0);
    float vpdMean        = trgData->vpdMeanTimeDifference(0);
    unsigned short vpdSE = trgData->vpdADCSum(east, 0);
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2017
\see StTriggerData2019
*/
